{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>To serve and to carry.</b> To serve at the encampment, and to carry at the time of journeying. Since above, when He said וּמִשְׁמֶרֶת בְּנֵי גֵרְשׁוֹן בְּאֹהֶל מוֹעֵד (Numbers 3:25), He spoke of their charge at the time of encampment, here He states that whatever was under their service in the charge of the encampment was likewise under the charge of carrying at the time of journeying."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:42.126699028Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}